                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">"While There's Still Time" - New Single featuring Paula Clare</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-300 mb-6">
                        Born from the creative synergy of songwriting partners Ed Vallee and Kelly Padrick, "While There's Still Time" emerged from the vibrant New York City music scene of the late 1980s.

Set against a light-hearted, medium-tempo reggae groove in a major key, the song’s emotional lyrics create a poignant contrast, revealing deep regret and longing beneath the upbeat rhythm. While the music suggests ease and sunshine, the words tell a story of lost love, missed chances, and a desperate hope to reconnect before time runs out. This juxtaposition highlights the bittersweet tension between the carefree sound and the heartfelt emotional weight of the message.

Fast forward thirty years later, “While There’s Still Time” conveys the timeless universal vibe with excellent studio production by Ed Vallee and captivating vocals by Paula Clare.
                    </p>
                    
